---
const wa = 'https://wa.me/54911XXXXXXXX?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20pedir%20Dulces%20de%20Mamá';
---
<section class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-5 pt-10 pb-9 text-center">
  <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2.35rem,8vw,3.4rem)] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-wide text-berry mb-3.5">
    El sabor de la<br />cocina de mamá
  </h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-md text-[1.05rem] text-muted">
    Mermeladas y dulces en lotes chicos, con fruta de temporada y el tiempo justo.
    Sin conservantes. Solo cariño.
  </p>
  <a
    href={wa}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener"
    class="inline-flex min-h-[52px] items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-berry px-8 py-3 font-semibold text-white-soft transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-berry-hover focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-peach"
  >
    Pedir por WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  </a>
</section>
